<h3 id=3D"orgfdbbff1">Continuing this thread, Paul-Elliot announced</h3>
<div class=3D"outline-text-3" id=3D"text-orgfdbbff1">
<p>
Another release was just <a href=3D"https://github.com/ocaml/opam-repositor=
y/pull/30652">merged</a> in opam!
</p>

<p>
Did you notice the trembling glass of water? That's the next release of Sli=
pshow that I'm announcing:
</p>
